[210.54774, "o", "evt-05906 | 5156 | 2026-05-06T14:35:00.992Z | WS-05.corp.example | PID matches: True, Text matches: True | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.  Application Information: \tProcess ID:\r\nevt-05956 | 5158 | 2026-05-06T14:35:05.020Z | WS-05.corp.example | PID matches: True, Text matches: True | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a bind to a local port.  Application Information: \tP\r\nevt-05959 | 5156 | 2026-05-06T14:35:06.013Z | WS-05.corp.example | PID matches: True, Text matches: True | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.  Application Information: \tProcess ID:\r\nevt-05975 | 5158 | 2026-05-06T14:35:11.029Z | WS-05.corp.example | PID matches: True, Text matches: True | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a bind to a local port.  Application Information: \tP\r\nevt-05976 | 5156 | 2026-05-06T14:35:11.029Z | WS-05.corp.example | PID matches: True, Text matches: True | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a connection.  Application Information: \tProcess ID:\r\nevt-05992 | 5158 | 2026-05-06T14:35:17.039Z | WS-05.corp.example | PID matches: True, Text matches: True | The Windows Filtering Platform has permitted a bind to a local port.  Application Information: \tP\r\n"]
